---
const { business } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="intro-sec">
  <div class="wrap intro" id="intro">
    <h1>Begini kami membayangkan <span class="grad">{business.name}</span> online.</h1>
    <p class="sub">Kami menyiapkan gambaran awal berdasarkan cerita yang Anda berikan.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .intro {
    padding-inline: clamp(1.25rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
</style>